  "body": "- Positioned on a private corner site\r\n- Master bedroom with ensuite\r\n- Family bathroom with bath and shower, plus underfloor heating for year-round comfort\r\n- Light-filled open-plan kitchen, living and outdoor entertainment\r\n- Quality finishes and easy, low-maintenance living\r\n-5 minutes from Orewa Beach, with motorway access and local amenities close by\r\n\r\nBrand-new, beautifully finished and ready to enjoy, this modern home offers an easy lifestyle in the growing Strathmill community.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area creates a bright and welcoming heart of the home, while the corner position brings added privacy, natural light and a greater sense of space.\r\n\r\nIdeal for first-home buyers, downsizers or investors looking for a quality new-build close to the coast.\r\n\r\nCall us today to arrange your private viewing, or come along to an upcoming open home.\r\n\r\nConjunctional sales from all agents are welcome.",
